caption:
Travis Scott @travisscott went to buy “Yeezus” and came home with a Mac Miller album instead Back in 2013, Travis headed to the store looking for Ye’s new album, only to find out they didn’t have a copy. He picked up Mac’s “Watching Movies with the Sound Off” instead , and ended up loving what he heard. Both projects arrived on June 18, 2013. Imagine walking into a record store that day and having to decide which album you were taking home.

